---

This repository is an independent, unofficial reproduction/study of the
algorithm described in:

  Jaehwan Lee and Sangoh Park, "An Efficient Memory Management for Mobile
  Operating Systems Based on Prediction of Relaunch Distance," Computer
  Systems Science and Engineering, vol. 47, no. 1, pp. 171-186, 2023.
  DOI: 10.32604/csse.2023.038139

The original paper is licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), which permits reuse with
attribution. This code is an original implementation written from the
paper's published description and is not derived from the authors' source
code (no official implementation is publicly available).
